SUMMARY:2026 Good Brick Tour
DTSTAMP:20260808T093528Z
DTSTART:20261107T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Save the date for Preservation Houston's 2026 Good Brick Tour\,
	 returning Saturday and Sunday\, November 7 and 8. Now in its 13th year\, 
	this annual self-guided tour offers a rare opportunity to step inside some
	 of Houston's most remarkable historic places and experience the city's ar
	chitectural heritage firsthand.\n\nhttps://www.preservationhouston.org/cal
	endar/2026/11/7/2026-good-brick-tour\n\nFrom Preservation Houston
URL:https://www.preservationhouston.org/calendar/2026/11/7/2026-good-brick-
	tour
GEO:29.7589;-95.3677
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:preservation-houston
CATEGORIES:Preservation Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT29H
END:VEVENT
